{% doc %}
  Announcement bar — ARCHITECTURE.md §6.1.

  ONE static line. Never rotating: the delivery cost is too valuable to share
  a slot, and extra costs appearing late is half of fixable cart abandonment.
  There is no `text` setting by design — see the note below.

  Wording: CONTENT.md §02.1. Figures: shop metafields, never typed.
{% enddoc %}

{%- comment -%}
  Why no free-text `text` setting, against ARCHITECTURE.md §6.1's setting list:
  a text field is precisely where a hard-coded "₹39" enters the theme and then
  drifts from `delivery_charge_kerala`. TASK-02 criterion 12 forbids exactly
  that. The line is composed from the metafields instead. Reported as a
  deviation rather than resolved silently.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- capture line -%}
  {%- render 'sv-announcement-line', class: 'sv-fine sv-fine--caps sv-announcement__line', link_url: section.settings.link_url -%}
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign line_stripped = line | strip -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Renders nothing when it has nothing true to say. An empty bar is worse than
  no bar, and a half-populated one shows only the half it has. The line itself
  is composed in snippets/sv-announcement-line.liquid, shared with the
  homepage hero's floating chrome (Phase 1.1).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if section.settings.show and line_stripped != blank -%}
  <aside class="sv-announcement" data-sv>
    <div class="w">{{ line_stripped }}</div>
  </aside>
{%- endif -%}

{% stylesheet %}
  /* Colour and spacing are tokens; the type comes from the .sv-fine primitive
     added in sv-system.css v1.2, which renders the line in sentence case as
     CONTENT.md §02.1 writes it, rather than the uppercase .lab was forcing. */
  [data-sv].sv-announcement {
    background: var(--emerald);
    padding: var(--a) 0;
  }

  /* [data-sv] p caps paragraphs at 56ch for readable body measure. The bar is
     chrome, not body copy: it must span the container or text-align:center
     centres it inside a 393px box sitting hard left. The compound selector is
     needed because [data-sv] p (0,1,1) outranks a bare class (0,1,0). */
  [data-sv].sv-announcement .sv-announcement__line {
    display: block;
    max-width: none;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--cream);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  a.sv-announcement__line:hover {
    opacity: 0.8;
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "SV Announcement",
  "tag": "section",
  "enabled_on": { "groups": ["header"] },
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show",
      "label": "Show the announcement bar",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "link_url",
      "label": "Link (optional)",
      "info": "The delivery figures are read from the shop metafields free_shipping_threshold and delivery_charge_kerala. Edit them in Settings → Custom data → Shop."
    }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "SV Announcement" }]
}
{% endschema %}
